    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n66942" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μέτασσαι</span></b> , αἱ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μεταγενεῖς</span>
			, of lambs, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χωρὶς μὲν πρόγονοι, χωρὶς
				δὲ μέτασσαι, χωρὶς δ᾽ αὖθ᾽ ἕρσαι</span>, i.e. the
			early-born, <i>those born later</i>, and the freshlings or
			late-born, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.221
			</span></i>:—also neut. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ</span></div>
